  "localFacts": [
    {"fact": "Somerset numbers its year in six terms and gives the number of days in each: 37, 35, 30, 24, 34 and 35 in 2026-27, a total of 195.", "source": "https://www.somerset.gov.uk/children-families-and-education/school-life/school-term-dates-and-holidays/"},
    {"fact": "Each year has 195 days in the calendar: pupils attend 190 and the remaining five are INSET days that each school chooses and must tell parents and staff about.", "source": "https://www.somerset.gov.uk/children-families-and-education/school-life/school-term-dates-and-holidays/"},
    {"fact": "The council says most academies, voluntary aided, foundation and free schools use the same dates as the council.", "source": "https://www.somerset.gov.uk/children-families-and-education/school-life/school-term-dates-and-holidays/"},
    {"fact": "In 2027-28 the year starts on Wednesday 1 September 2027, and the Christmas holiday starts on Saturday 18 December 2027.", "source": "https://www.somerset.gov.uk/children-families-and-education/school-life/school-term-dates-and-holidays/"},
    {"fact": "The 2027-28 table lists term 6 as '5 June – 21 July 2027', a typing slip for 2028, as the holiday that follows runs from 24 July to 31 August 2028.", "source": "https://www.somerset.gov.uk/children-families-and-education/school-life/school-term-dates-and-holidays/"},
